window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Before Owen Deathstalker, there was the Twilight of the Empire . . . <br> <br> <i>Mistworld.</i> The day would come when it would be a key world in Owen Deathstalker's Rebellion. Now, it's as it's always been, a world on the edge of the Empire, a lawless one, shielded from the outside by powerful ESPers. A world where Leon Vertue can run his body bank, where a burglar like Cat has more to fear from other thieves than the Empress' justice, a world where Investigator Topaz is determined to make her mark.<br> <br> <i>Mistworld.</i> \"Green moves his plot at top speed, and his characters are alive and his background solid.\" —Baird Searles in <i>Asimov's Science Fiction</i> magazine</p>"; 
